// specs/corona/anchor.t27
// TG-TRIAD-X cross-die anchor (carried forward unchanged from Phi/Euler/Gamma).
// phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

// Status: [Verified in sim] for Phi, Euler, Gamma RTL.
